window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"rumble","b":"masteryi","win":["Rumble","Rumble","Rumble","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"Flamespitter plus your shield zone him out entirely — he cannot touch the wave for free."},{"when":"Level 2","text":"Electro Harpoon slows and poke keep him permanently off you — extend the lead."},{"when":"Yi level 6","text":"Highlander grants slow immunity, so harpoons stop nothing — the free lane ends."},{"when":"Yi first item","text":"Wuju Style true damage ignores MR, so stacking it saves nothing; never duel him."}],"wants":{"you":["Every early wave taxed with flame","A CS and HP lead banked before his 6","Teamfights where Equalizer covers you"],"foe":["A quiet scaling lane into Highlander","Isolated duels after his first item","You caught alone with no slows ready"]},"early":"The first three levels are a stomp: Flamespitter plus your shield zone him off the wave at 1, and Electro Harpoon slows keep him off you entirely from 2. By 4-5 it evens — his ramping Wuju damage lets him fight through the flame if you overheat at the wrong moment — so bank the lead before then.","mid":"At 6 the matchup inverts: Highlander is slow-immune, so Electro Harpoon no longer holds him off and the duel is his. You have zero hard CC, so Meditate heals uninterrupted — buy Grievous Wounds if he channels. Shove with flame, ward deep, and spend the mid game grouped, not in 1v1s.","late":"Late he shreds a CC-light Rumble on contact, so make contact the hard part: fight from behind your frontline and hold Equalizer and the E slows for the window his 85-second Highlander is down — he is slow-immune while it runs. You win the teamfight zone; he wins every duel.","whys":["Your Flamespitter and shield zone him out at level 1 — he cannot approach for free.","At 2 your Electro Harpoon slow and poke keep him off you completely.","At 3 your full kit still controls the lane spacing — every trade is on your terms.","Levels 4-5 turn even as his ramping damage lets him fight through the flame if you overheat.","Highlander makes him immune to slows, so your harpoons stop nothing — the flip point.","His first item plus Wuju Style true damage beats any MR you buy in melee — his stage.","Late he shreds a CC-light Rumble whenever he reaches you — only team cover answers it."]});
